1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:00,840
How long until they

2
00:00:00,870 --> 00:00:02,210
reach the rock?

3
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,390
The tide is going out.

4
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,910
The zombies are walking in.

5
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,570
Two miles of open sand.

6
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,150
Forty minutes, maybe less.

7
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,440
No walls. No guns.

8
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,410
No time.

9
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,740
Every second counts.

10
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:14,790
Every gallon too.

11
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:15,960
But he has diesel.

12
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,240
Eight hundred gallons of it.

13
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,960
He drags the first drum

14
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:20,180
down the rocks.

15
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,480
At the island's edge

16
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:25,330
the sand narrows to a neck. Twelve feet wide.

17
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:26,600
He digs a trench.

18
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,640
Knee deep.

19
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,750
He rolls out the drums.

20
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,850
Pours two hundred gallons.

21
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:32,940
The first zombies

22
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:33,900
reach the trench.

23
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:34,790
He lights it.

24
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,030
A wall of fire.

25
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,920
The first wave stops.

26
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:38,950
It works.

27
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:39,660
For now.

28
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,930
Then the tide turns

29
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,620
and the sea swallows the sand.

30
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,620
The fire dies.

31
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,070
The causeway disappears.

32
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:45,970
He's safe until

33
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,190
tomorrow's low tide.

34
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:48,130
But he just burned

35
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,280
a quarter of his fuel.

36
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,460
And the smoke is rising.

37
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,660
A thousand feet.

38
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:52,690
Smoke you can see

39
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:53,600
for thirty miles.

40
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,020
Someone is going to see it.

41
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:59,530
Part four. Someone saw the smoke. Follow for part four.
